        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Deal with the Devil&quot; is a fast, brutal solitaire card game. Discard using strict four-card rules before the clock runs out. Learn the patterns, gamble on draws, and climb the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to start, but devilish to master. Challenge yourself and your friends. The game can be won, but it's very difficult. Most hands are unwinnable due to strict discard rules and bad luck with draws. A small percentage of games end tantalizingly close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Five-minute runs; bite-sized and tense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hell Mode: 45 seconds, one mistake ends it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Global leaderboards for wins &amp; losses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Achievements and secrets to uncover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clean, readable UI built for quick retries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game can run on Linux using Proton.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Deal with the Devil&quot; is a fast, brutal solitaire card game. Discard using strict four-card rules before the clock runs out. Learn the patterns, gamble on draws, and climb the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to start, but devilish to master. Challenge yourself and your friends. The game can be won, but it's very difficult. Most hands are unwinnable due to strict discard rules and bad luck with draws. A small percentage of games end tantalizingly close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Five-minute runs; bite-sized and tense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hell Mode: 45 seconds, one mistake ends it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Global leaderboards for wins &amp; losses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Achievements and secrets to uncover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clean, readable UI built for quick retries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game can run on Linux using Proton.</p>",
